== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Dark Elf Warrior, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: We, the Indigo Brotherhood, are the children of Innoruuk. He has blessed us well with Hate. Take this note to [[Seloxia Punox]] at the Cauldron of Hate. She will help train you to serve the will of Innoruuk.

Upon handing the note to [[Seloxia Punox]]:

: [[Seloxia Punox]] says, 'Welcome to the Indigo Brotherhood. Hmmm, you're a bit scrawny, but we'll work with it. Here's your guild tunic. Defend Neriak and all her allies.'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standings with [[Indigo Brotherhood]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[Emerald Warriors]] got worse.
* Your faction standings with [[Steel Warriors]] got worse.
* Your faction standings with [[Primordial Malice]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Old Training Tunic*]]. Good luck, Warrior!

